    title: "Takaichi heads to Asia summits with focus on warming chilly ties with China",
    summary: "The Japanese leader is visiting the Philippines and China, where a key focus will be improving ties with Beijing and like-minded partners.",
    preview: "Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi arrived Monday in Manila for four days of international summitry in the Philippines and China, where a key focus will be whether she can add some warmth to chilly ties with Beijing. Just ahead of her departure, Takaichi told reporters that strengthening the Japan-led “Free and Open Indo-Pacific Strategy” would be a crucial element of her trip.",
    body: "Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi arrived Monday in Manila for four days of international summitry in the Philippines and China, where a key focus will be whether she can add some warmth to chilly ties with Beijing.\n\nJust ahead of her departure, Takaichi told reporters that strengthening the Japan-led “Free and Open Indo-Pacific Strategy” would be a crucial element of her trip.\n\n“As the international community faces historic changes, I intend to convey Japan’s efforts to maintain and strengthen a free and open international order based on the rule of law, and to confirm cooperation with other nations toward that end,” she said.",
